{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122841","id":4367069488,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBEwxMA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122841","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122841.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122841.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122841","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122841/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122841/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122841/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/735e5bc415ae58031fe06fa4bd6a938c33b16d4c","number":122841,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix divide by zero in scale check in RenderGeometryInstanceBase","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis code exists in `RenderGeometryInstanceBase::set_transform`:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nnon_uniform_scale = max_scale >= 0.0 && (min_scale / max_scale) < 0.999;\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis code is wrong for 2 reasons:\r\n\r\n1) If `max_scale` equals zero, then `/ max_scale` will fail, as shown by this sanitizer error:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nservers/rendering/renderer_geometry_instance.cpp:78:53: runtime error: division by zero\r\n```\r\n\r\n2) The check `max_scale >= 0.0` does not make any sense due to how the value originates. The value gets distilled from `.get_scale_abs()`. The comparison `abs(x) >= 0.0` will always be true (except for NaN).\r\n\r\nFor both of these reasons, surely `>` was intended. This PR fixes it by changing `>=` to `>`.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI used AI to search for fixes to runtime errors on the godot-dimensions CI, and I am verifying each one as I submit upstream. This one is... very trivial, but I still checked anyway.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_u